data: {"type":"toolResult","tool_result":{"call":{"provider":"call_WzgKsrVk7kuQtOJQ4ucpWA9I"},"name":"search_world","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Sablecross reservoir (reservoir) [ID: 2a3ca8de-f578-4c53-a2cf-78f147162aee]: A reservoir in Sablecross, historically fed by the Glass Aqueduct before its destruction in 204.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← FEEDS from Glass Aqueduct (aqueduct) [ID: 0a05f0fd-2132-40c5-b10c-63a7f2b9d187]: The Glass Aqueduct once ran from the Basalt Hills to feed the Sablecross reservoir. The Sablecross council owns it. Mira Venn maintained it before its permanent destruction by a landslide in 204. It has not been rebuilt, and there is no alternate aqueduct or bypass.\n    Neighbor properties: alternate_aqueduct_or_bypass: false; destroyed_in: 204; destruction_cause: landslide; destruction_permanent: true; rebuilt: false; source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: Before its destruction in 204, the Glass Aqueduct fed the Sablecross reservoir.\n    Relationship properties: condition: before destruction in 204; source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← GUARDS from Oren Dask (person) [ID: 4f6cb7f9-103d-41a5-93d2-3ed615a419fa] [Aliases: Warden]: Oren Dask guards the Sablecross reservoir and refuses to let soldiers draw water without a council permit. He is also called the Warden. He is Mira Venn's friend and the only person who knows she keeps a cracked jade compass inside her right boot.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: Oren Dask guards the Sablecross reservoir.\n    Relationship properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - LOCATED_IN → Sablecross (city) [ID: 1016d1ca-4f7d-4d74-bdc6-6522d6bb1947]: A city in Ardent Reach.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: The reservoir is in Sablecross.\n    Relationship properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n\nMira Venn (person, engineer) [ID: 7d2fec61-8487-4192-8bf3-db75accaaa8f]: An engineer who maintained the Glass Aqueduct before its destruction in 204. She was born in Greyhaven, a small town on the coast, and moved to Sablecross as an adult. She keeps a cracked jade compass inside her right boot; only her friend Oren Dask knows about it.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - MAINTAINS → Glass Aqueduct (aqueduct) [ID: 0a05f0fd-2132-40c5-b10c-63a7f2b9d187]: The Glass Aqueduct once ran from the Basalt Hills to feed the Sablecross reservoir. The Sablecross council owns it. Mira Venn maintained it before its permanent destruction by a landslide in 204. It has not been rebuilt, and there is no alternate aqueduct or bypass.\n    Neighbor properties: alternate_aqueduct_or_bypass: false; destroyed_in: 204; destruction_cause: landslide; destruction_permanent: true; rebuilt: false; source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: Mira Venn maintained the Glass Aqueduct before its destruction in 204.\n    Relationship properties: condition: before destruction in 204; source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - MOVED_TO → Sablecross (city) [ID: 1016d1ca-4f7d-4d74-bdc6-6522d6bb1947]: A city in Ardent Reach.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: Mira Venn moved to Sablecross as an adult.\n    Relationship properties: condition: as an adult; source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - FRIEND_OF → Oren Dask (person) [ID: 4f6cb7f9-103d-41a5-93d2-3ed615a419fa] [Aliases: Warden]: Oren Dask guards the Sablecross reservoir and refuses to let soldiers draw water without a council permit. He is also called the Warden. He is Mira Venn's friend and the only person who knows she keeps a cracked jade compass inside her right boot.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: Mira Venn and Oren Dask are friends.\n    Relationship properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - CARRIES → Cracked jade compass (compass, object) [ID: 7e23d4d7-7bfd-4ce7-9db3-91d1ebe3ee71]: A cracked jade compass that Mira Venn keeps inside her right boot. Only her friend Oren Dask knows about it.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: Mira Venn keeps the cracked jade compass inside her right boot.\n    Relationship properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - BORN_IN → Greyhaven (town, coastal settlement) [ID: 70ce38c9-4472-43bc-8fd0-7733401ad249]: A small town on the coast.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: Mira Venn was born in Greyhaven.\n    Relationship properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n\nSablecross (city) [ID: 1016d1ca-4f7d-4d74-bdc6-6522d6bb1947]: A city in Ardent Reach.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← LOCATED_IN from Sablecross reservoir (reservoir) [ID: 2a3ca8de-f578-4c53-a2cf-78f147162aee]: A reservoir in Sablecross, historically fed by the Glass Aqueduct before its destruction in 204.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: The reservoir is in Sablecross.\n    Relationship properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← MOVED_TO from Mira Venn (person, engineer) [ID: 7d2fec61-8487-4192-8bf3-db75accaaa8f]: An engineer who maintained the Glass Aqueduct before its destruction in 204. She was born in Greyhaven, a small town on the coast, and moved to Sablecross as an adult. She keeps a cracked jade compass inside her right boot; only her friend Oren Dask knows about it.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: Mira Venn moved to Sablecross as an adult.\n    Relationship properties: condition: as an adult; source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - LOCATED_IN → Ardent Reach (region) [ID: 47246434-b9cd-4afa-ad76-9003866fd11f]: A desert region.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: Sablecross is a city in Ardent Reach.\n    Relationship properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n\nGlass Aqueduct (aqueduct) [ID: 0a05f0fd-2132-40c5-b10c-63a7f2b9d187]: The Glass Aqueduct once ran from the Basalt Hills to feed the Sablecross reservoir. The Sablecross council owns it. Mira Venn maintained it before its permanent destruction by a landslide in 204. It has not been rebuilt, and there is no alternate aqueduct or bypass.\n  Properties: alternate_aqueduct_or_bypass: false; destroyed_in: 204; destruction_cause: landslide; destruction_permanent: true; rebuilt: false; source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← MAINTAINS from Mira Venn (person, engineer) [ID: 7d2fec61-8487-4192-8bf3-db75accaaa8f]: An engineer who maintained the Glass Aqueduct before its destruction in 204. She was born in Greyhaven, a small town on the coast, and moved to Sablecross as an adult. She keeps a cracked jade compass inside her right boot; only her friend Oren Dask knows about it.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: Mira Venn maintained the Glass Aqueduct before its destruction in 204.\n    Relationship properties: condition: before destruction in 204; source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← OWNS from Sablecross council (council, governing body) [ID: ccb30b2e-6e33-42d7-a6d2-a754da506f10]: The owner of the Glass Aqueduct.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: The Sablecross council owns the Glass Aqueduct; Mira Venn does not.\n    Relationship properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← PLANS_FOR from Original aqueduct plans (plans, document) [ID: d5476f0a-57e4-43dc-b873-003fd4024e30]: The original aqueduct plans, kept in the Sun Archive.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: The original aqueduct plans are for the Glass Aqueduct.\n    Relationship properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - FEEDS → Sablecross reservoir (reservoir) [ID: 2a3ca8de-f578-4c53-a2cf-78f147162aee]: A reservoir in Sablecross, historically fed by the Glass Aqueduct before its destruction in 204.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: Before its destruction in 204, the Glass Aqueduct fed the Sablecross reservoir.\n    Relationship properties: condition: before destruction in 204; source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - RUNS_FROM → Basalt Hills (hills, geographic feature) [ID: 2ec99b4b-9d81-4b3e-8da3-e77d88559be1]: Hills from which the Glass Aqueduct comes.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: The Glass Aqueduct comes from the Basalt Hills.\n    Relationship properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n\nOriginal aqueduct plans (plans, document) [ID: d5476f0a-57e4-43dc-b873-003fd4024e30]: The original aqueduct plans, kept in the Sun Archive.\n  Properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n  - ← CONTAINS from Sun Archive (archive) [ID: e7e97d97-f1a0-4a74-98e5-6f4cd1c78282]: The Sun Archive is kept by Lysa Renn, contains the original aqueduct plans, and admits civilian scholars during daylight only.\n    Neighbor properties: source_conversation: 01a18777-7744-715a-a990-daf20fc93f3f\n    Relationship: T