data: {"type":"streamAssistantItem","item":"event","value":{"event":"end","part":1,"content":{"type":"text","text":"I don’t see any unresolved contradictions in the saved lore.\n\nTwo apparent tensions are already explained by the facts recorded:\n\n- **“Warden”** refers to both Oren Dask, who guards the reservoir, and Lysa Renn, who keeps the Sun Archive. The lore identifies them as separate, unrelated people.\n- The **Glass Aqueduct fed the reservoir** before its destruction in 204; it is now permanently destroyed and has not been rebuilt. Those statements describe different periods, not conflicting versions."}}}

